  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><span>这个模组是一个末日主题模组，包含多种类型的近战武器、独特的结构和战利品。模组还添加了自定义护甲。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>- 在最新更新中，你需要穿上化学防护服才能进入新的生物群系。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>- 为了在1.18.2及更高版本中运行此模组，需要安装GeckoLib模组：\nGeckoLib : <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files</a></span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
